Updated .gitignore with .mp4/.mov/.avi/.mkv rules so the demo videos drop off. But rather than have you re-download and re-rename the whole file, it's easier to just add those four lines to your existing .gitignore directly. Open it (in RStudio, or Notepad) and add at the bottom:

