A few small things to tidy before you commit (none critical, but worth it):

The two .mp4 files — add those four *.mp4 etc. lines to .gitignore (as I mentioned), they'll drop off. 80MB of video doesn't belong in a code repo.
.Rhistory — that's RStudio's command history, machine-specific noise. Add .Rhistory to .gitignore too.
findstr — there's a file literally called findstr (no extension). That's an accident, it got created when you ran the findstr /i /m "micromamba" command earlier (a stray redirect or typo captured output to a file). Delete it, it's junk:
